"issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI would like to get the current speed of the drone as telemetry when it is doing a mission. Could not find it in telemetry API. Is the ground velocity the current speed of the drone?\r\nAnd I would also like to change the current heading of the drone when it is in HOLD mode.  Is there anyway to do it ?\r\n\r\nThanks in advance.", "closed_by": {"login": "YalamareddyChaitanya", "id": 70040710, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQwNzEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70040710?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya", "html_url": "https://github.com/YalamareddyChaitanya", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1104528704", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749#issuecomment-1104528704", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749", "id": 1104528704, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5B1cVA", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-04-20T22:48:24Z", "updated_at": "2022-04-20T22:48:24Z", "body": "> Is the ground velocity the current speed of the drone?\r\n\r\nI guess there are two speeds you may be interested in:\r\n1. The [ground speed](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/blob/main/protos/telemetry/telemetry.proto#L38)\r\n2. The airspeed (which comes with the [`FixedwingMetrics`](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/blob/main/protos/telemetry/telemetry.proto#L755)).\r\n\r\nNow if what's unclear is the meaning of \"ground velocity\":\r\n* The ground speed is the speed relative to the ground. So if you are on the ground and the ground speed says \"2 m/s\", then for you the drone is moving at 2 m/s in some direction.\r\n* The airspeed is the speed relative to the air. So if the drone flies against the wind at 2 m/s, and the wind speed is 2 m/s, then the ground speed will be 0, but the airspeed will be 2. The drone is flying at 2 m/s, but from your perspective on the ground, it is not \"moving\".\r\n\r\nDoes that help?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1104528704/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1105102525", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749#issuecomment-1105102525", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1749", "id": 1105102525, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5B3oa9", "user": {"login": "YalamareddyChaitanya", "id": 70040710, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQwNzEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70040710?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya", "html_url": "https://github.com/YalamareddyChaitanya", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/repos", "events_ur